{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loopmage</strong> is a minimal, streamlined horde-survivor. The question isn\u2019t <i>if</i> you\u2019ll die - it\u2019s <i>when</i>. How far up the leaderboard can you climb?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain XP, level up, and refine your abilities. Complete a loop of three stages to strengthen your wizard\u2026 and empower your enemies for the next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057380/extras/ccc95ff17cf2330ce386f681cf30d0fd.poster.avif?t=1760720579\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057380/extras/ccc95ff17cf2330ce386f681cf30d0fd.webm?t=1760720579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057380/extras/ccc95ff17cf2330ce386f681cf30d0fd.mp4?t=1760720579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057380/extras/b0295005f31f54462c453d5a0da019f1.poster.avif?t=1760720579\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057380/extras/b0295005f31f54462c453d5a0da019f1.webm?t=1760720579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057380/extras/b0295005f31f54462c453d5a0da019f1.mp4?t=1760720579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain ability upgrade choices as you defeat enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"